{"strongs": "H7181", "word": "קָשַׁב", "translit": "qa.shav", "root": "קשב", "morph": "H:V", "pos": "verb", "gloss": "incline, attend", "definition": "[ קָשַׁב ] 46 verb incline, attend , of ears; — Qal Imperfect 3 feminine plural תִּקְשַׁבְנָה Isa 32:3 (subject אזנים ). Hiph`il Perfect 3 masculine singular הִקְשִׁיב Jer 23:18 ; Ps 66:19 , etc.; Imperfect 3 masculine singular יַקְשִׁב Isa 42:23 , etc.; Imperative masculine singular הַקְשֵׁב Job 33:21 , especially הַקְשִׁ֫יבָה Ps 5:3 +, etc.; Infinitive construct הַקְשִׁיב 1Sam 15:22 +; Participle מַקְשִׁיב Prov 1:24 +, plural מַקְשִׁיבִים Song 8:13 — give attention (sometimes + שָׁמַע ); absolute Hos 5:1 ; 1Sam 15:22 ; Isa 10:30 ; Isa 28:23 ; Isa 34:1 ; Isa 49:1 ; Mic 1:2 + 12 t.; + אֶל person Jer 18:19 ; Zech 1:4 ; Isa 51:4 (|| הֶאֱזִינוּ ), לְ person Ps 55:3 + אֶל of thing Jer 18:18 ; Neh 9:34 ; Ps 142:7 , עַל of thing Jer 6:19 ; Prov 17:4 ; Prov 29:12 , ל of thing Jer 6:17 ; Isa 48:18 ; Prov 4:20 ; Prov 5:1 ; Prov 7:24 ; Ps 5:3 ; Song 8:13 , ב of thing Ps 66:19 ; Ps 86:6 also with accusative of thing Jer 23:18 ; Job 13:6 ; Ps 17:1 ; Ps 61:2 accusative of congnate meaning with verb Isa 21:7 apparently = cause to attend , with accusative אָזְנֶ֑ךָ Prov 2:2 (+ ל of thing), Ps 10:17 , but usage would be so late and rare that אָזֱנ֑ךָ is probably subj. thing ( Ges «GKC:144m»§ 144m Da Synt. § 109. R. 3 ).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7631')\">BDB7631</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H7181')\">H7181</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7630')\">BDB7630</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7632')\">BDB7632</entry></div><p> [<bdbheb>קָשַׁב</bdbheb>]<sub>46</sub> <b>verb</b> <highlightword>incline, attend</highlightword>, of ears; — <div class=\"point\"><b>Qal</b> <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> 3 feminine plural <bdbheb>תִּקְשַׁבְנָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 32:3\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(23,32,3)\">Isa 32: